<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>경락잔금대출 LTV 한도 계산기</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #F7F6F2;
  --surface: #FFFFFF;
  --border: #E4E2DA;
  --border-strong: #C8C5BB;
  --text: #1A1917;
  --text-muted: #6B6860;
  --text-hint: #9E9C96;
  --accent: #1A4FBF;
  --accent-bg: #EEF3FF;
  --accent-text: #0F3399;
  --success: #0A6640;
  --success-bg: #E6F5EE;
  --danger: #B01C1C;
  --danger-bg: #FDF0F0;
  --danger-border: #F5C0C0;
  --warn: #7A4A00;
  --warn-bg: #FFF8EC;
  --warn-border: #F0D080;
  --mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  --sans: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
  --radius: 10px;
  --radius-sm: 6px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.container {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.header {
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.header h1 {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.header p {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.step-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-hint);
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.seg {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.seg:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

.seg button {
  padding: 8px 18px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-weight: 500;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 100px;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text-muted);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all .15s;
}

.seg button:hover:not(.on) {
  border-color: var(--border-strong);
  color: var(--text);
}

.seg button.on {
  background: var(--text);
  color: #fff;
  border-color: var(--text);
}

.divider {
  border: none;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  margin: 1.25rem 0;
}

.field { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.field:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

.field label {
  display: block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
}

.field-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
}

.input-wrap { position: relative; }

.input-wrap input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 10px 44px 10px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  font-size: 15px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  transition: border-color .15s;
  outline: none;
}

.input-wrap input:focus {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  background: #fff;
}

.input-wrap input::placeholder { color: var(--text-hint); }

.input-wrap .suffix {
  position: absolute;
  right: 12px;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-hint);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.calc-btn {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
  padding: 12px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  letter-spacing: .02em;
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  background: var(--text);
  color: #fff;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: opacity .15s;
}

.calc-btn:hover { opacity: .85; }
.calc-btn:active { opacity: .7; }

.alert {
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.alert-danger {
  background: var(--danger-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--danger-border);
}

.alert-danger .alert-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--danger);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.alert-danger .alert-desc {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #8B1414;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.alert-info {
  background: var(--accent-bg);
  border: 1px solid #C0D0F5;
}

.alert-info .alert-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent-text);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.alert-info .alert-desc {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #1A4FBF;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.result-card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  display: none;
}

.result-card.show { display: block; }

.metric-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.metric {
  background: var(--bg);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  padding: .75rem;
}

.metric .ml {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-hint);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
}

.metric .mv {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  color: var(--text);
}

.metric .mv.ok { color: var(--success); }
.metric .mv.warn { color: var(--warn); }

.result-rows { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

.result-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  gap: 12px;
}

.result-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.result-row .rl {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.result-row .rv {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-align: right;
}

.highlight-row {
  background: var(--success-bg);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  padding: 14px 16px;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.highlight-row.warn-row { background: var(--warn-bg); }

.highlight-row .hl { font-size: 13px; color: var(--success); font-weight: 500; }
.highlight-row.warn-row .hl { color: var(--warn); }

.highlight-row .hv {
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  color: var(--success);
  letter-spacing: -.02em;
}

.highlight-row.warn-row .hv { color: var(--warn); }

.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  padding: 2px 8px;
  border-radius: 100px;
  margin-left: 6px;
}

.badge-info { background: var(--accent-bg); color: var(--accent-text); }
.badge-warn { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn); border: 1px solid var(--warn-border); }

.note {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-hint);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  padding-top: .75rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.hidden { display: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>경락잔금대출 LTV 한도 계산기</h1>
    <p>주택 경매 낙찰 시 대출 가능 한도를 산출합니다</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="step-label">Step 1 &nbsp;구분 선택</div>
    <div class="seg" id="seg-type">
      <button class="on" onclick="setType(this,'none')">무주택자</button>
      <button onclick="setType(this,'own1plus')">1주택 이상</button>
      <button onclick="setType(this,'biz')">매매사업자</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 무주택자 -->
    <div id="section-none">
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="step-label">Step 2 &nbsp;특례 선택</div>
      <div class="seg" id="seg-special">
        <button class="on" onclick="setSpecial(this,'first')">생애최초</button>
        <button onclick="setSpecial(this,'low')">서민실수요자</button>
        <button onclick="setSpecial(this,'general')">일반</button>
      </div>
      <div id="none-region-wrap" class="hidden">
        <div class="step-label">Step 3 &nbsp;지역 선택</div>
        <div class="seg" id="seg-region-none">
          <button class="on" onclick="setNoneRegion(this,'reg')">규제지역</button>
          <button onclick="setNoneRegion(this,'gyeonggi')">경기비규제</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <div class="field">
          <label>감정가</label>
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <input type="number" id="none-appraisal" placeholder="0" min="0">
            <span class="suffix">만원</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>낙찰가</label>
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <input type="number" id="none-bid" placeholder="0" min="0">
            <span class="suffix">만원</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="calc-btn" onclick="calcNone()">한도 계산하기</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 1주택 이상 -->
    <div id="section-own1plus" class="hidden">
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="alert alert-danger">
        <div class="alert-title">수도권 경락잔금대출 불가</div>
        <div class="alert-desc">1주택 이상 보유자는 규제지역·경기비규제 등 수도권 전 지역에서 경락잔금대출이 불가합니다.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="alert alert-info">
        <div class="alert-title">지방은 매매사업자 대출 가능</div>
        <div class="alert-desc">지방 물건은 매매사업자 대출로 낙찰가 80% / 감정가 60% 한도 대출이 가능합니다.<br>위 <strong>매매사업자</strong> 탭을 선택해 계산하세요.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 매매사업자 -->
    <div id="section-biz" class="hidden">
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="step-label">Step 2 &nbsp;지역 선택</div>
      <div class="seg" id="seg-region-biz">
        <button class="on" onclick="setBizRegion(this,'metro')">수도권</button>
        <button onclick="setBizRegion(this,'local')">지방</button>
      </div>
      <div id="biz-block" class="alert alert-danger">
        <div class="alert-title">수도권 불가</div>
        <div class="alert-desc">매매사업자 대출은 수도권에서 불가합니다. 지방 물건만 가능합니다.</div>
      </div>
      <div id="biz-form" class="hidden">
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label>감정가</label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="number" id="biz-appraisal" placeholder="0" min="0">
              <span class="suffix">만원</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>낙찰가</label>
            <div class="input-wrap">
              <input type="number" id="biz-bid" placeholder="0" min="0">
              <span class="suffix">만원</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="calc-btn" onclick="calcBiz()">한도 계산하기</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 무주택 결과 -->
  <div class="result-card" id="none-result"></div>

  <!-- 매매사업자 결과 -->
  <div class="result-card" id="biz-result"></div>
</div>

<script>
let curSpecial = 'first';
let curNoneRegion = 'reg';
let curBizRegion = 'metro';

function fmt(n) { return Math.round(n).toLocaleString('ko-KR'); }

function setType(el, v) {
  document.querySelectorAll('#seg-type button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('on'));
  el.classList.add('on');
  document.getElementById('section-none').classList.toggle('hidden', v !== 'none');
  document.getElementById('section-own1plus').classList.toggle('hidden', v !== 'own1plus');
  document.getElementById('section-biz').classList.toggle('hidden', v !== 'biz');
  document.getElementById('none-result').classList.remove('show');
  document.getElementById('biz-result').classList.remove('show');
}

function setSpecial(el, v) {
  curSpecial = v;
  document.querySelectorAll('#seg-special button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('on'));
  el.classList.add('on');
  document.getElementById('none-region-wrap').classList.toggle('hidden', v !== 'general');
  document.getElementById('none-result').classList.remove('show');
}

function setNoneRegion(el, v) {
  curNoneRegion = v;
  document.querySelectorAll('#seg-region-none button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('on'));
  el.classList.add('on');
  document.getElementById('none-result').classList.remove('show');
}

function setBizRegion(el, v) {
  curBizRegion = v;
  document.querySelectorAll('#seg-region-biz button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('on'));
  el.classList.add('on');
  const metro = (v === 'metro');
  document.getElementById('biz-block').style.display = metro ? 'block' : 'none';
  document.getElementById('biz-form').classList.toggle('hidden', metro);
  document.getElementById('biz-result').classList.remove('show');
}

function calcNone() {
  const app = parseFloat(document.getElementById('none-appraisal').value) || 0;
  const bid = parseFloat(document.getElementById('none-bid').value) || 0;
  if (!app || !bid) { alert('감정가와 낙찰가를 입력하세요.'); return; }

  let rate, cap = null, label, regionLabel;
  if (curSpecial === 'first') {
    rate = 80; label = '생애최초';
    regionLabel = curNoneRegion === 'reg' ? '규제지역' : '경기비규제';
    if (curNoneRegion === 'reg') cap = 60000;
  } else if (curSpecial === 'low') {
    rate = 70; label = '서민실수요자';
    regionLabel = curNoneRegion === 'reg' ? '규제지역' : '경기비규제';
    if (curNoneRegion === 'reg') cap = 60000;
  } else {
    rate = curNoneRegion === 'reg' ? 40 : 70;
    label = '일반 무주택';
    regionLabel = curNoneRegion === 'reg' ? '규제지역' : '경기비규제';
  }

  const base = Math.min(app, bid);
  let limit = base * rate / 100;
  let capped = false;
  if (cap && limit > cap) { limit = cap; capped = true; }
  const bidRatio = Math.round(bid / app * 100);
  const isCheap = bidRatio <= 80;

  document.getElementById('none-result').innerHTML = `
    <div class="metric-grid">
      <div class="metric"><div class="ml">감정가</div><div class="mv">${fmt(app)}<span style="font-size:11px;font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--text-hint);margin-left:2px">만</span></div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="ml">낙찰가</div><div class="mv">${fmt(bid)}<span style="font-size:11px;font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--text-hint);margin-left:2px">만</span></div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="ml">낙찰가율</div><div class="mv ${isCheap ? 'ok' : 'warn'}">${bidRatio}%</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="result-rows">
      <div class="result-row"><span class="rl">구분</span><span class="rv">${label} <span class="badge badge-info">${regionLabel}</span></span></div>
      <div class="result-row"><span class="rl">적용 LTV</span><span class="rv">${rate}%</span></div>
      <div class="result-row"><span class="rl">기준 금액 (감정가·낙찰가 중 낮은 금액)</span><span class="rv">${fmt(base)}만원</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="highlight-row ${capped ? 'warn-row' : ''}">
      <span class="hl">최대 대출 한도${capped ? ' <span class="badge badge-warn">6억 한도 적용</span>' : ''}</span>
      <span class="hv">${fmt(limit)}만원</span>
    </div>
    ${capped ? '<p class="note" style="margin-top:.75rem;border-top:none">규제지역 생애최초·서민실수요자는 6억원 한도가 적용됩니다.</p>' : ''}
    <p class="note">※ 실제 한도는 금융기관 DSR 심사, 기존 부채, 소득 등에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p>
  `;
  document.getElementById('none-result').classList.add('show');
}

function calcBiz() {
  const app = parseFloat(document.getElementById('biz-appraisal').value) || 0;
  const bid = parseFloat(document.getElementById('biz-bid').value) || 0;
  if (!app || !bid) { alert('감정가와 낙찰가를 입력하세요.'); return; }

  const byBid = Math.round(bid * 0.8);
  const byApp = Math.round(app * 0.6);
  const limit = Math.min(byBid, byApp);
  const bidRatio = Math.round(bid / app * 100);
  const isCheap = bidRatio <= 80;

  document.getElementById('biz-result').innerHTML = `
    <div class="metric-grid">
      <div class="metric"><div class="ml">감정가</div><div class="mv">${fmt(app)}<span style="font-size:11px;font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--text-hint);margin-left:2px">만</span></div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="ml">낙찰가</div><div class="mv">${fmt(bid)}<span style="font-size:11px;font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--text-hint);margin-left:2px">만</span></div></div>
      <div class="metric"><div class="ml">낙찰가율</div><div class="mv ${isCheap ? 'ok' : 'warn'}">${bidRatio}%</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="result-rows">
      <div class="result-row"><span class="rl">구분</span><span class="rv">매매사업자 <span class="badge badge-info">지방</span></span></div>
      <div class="result-row"><span class="rl">낙찰가 기준 (80%)</span><span class="rv">${fmt(byBid)}만원</span></div>
      <div class="result-row"><span class="rl">감정가 기준 (60%)</span><span class="rv">${fmt(byApp)}만원</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="highlight-row">
      <span class="hl">최대 대출 한도 (낮은 금액 적용)</span>
      <span class="hv">${fmt(limit)}만원</span>
    </div>
    <p class="note">※ 낙찰가 80%와 감정가 60% 중 낮은 금액이 적용됩니다. 실제 한도는 금융기관 심사에 따라 다를 수 있습니다.</p>
  `;
  document.getElementById('biz-result').classList.add('show');
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
